## 🔧 **Troubleshooting & Solutions**

### **Major Issues Resolved**

| Problem | Solution | Documentation |
|---------|----------|---------------|
| **Redis permission denied** | Created user-owned directory: `/home/developer/redis-data` | [Redis Fix](#redis-setup) |
| **PostgreSQL won't start** | Initialized with `initdb`, fixed permissions | [PostgreSQL Setup](#database--services-configuration) |
| **Next.js 404 on income page** | Correct file structure: `app/dashboard/income/page.tsx` | [File Structure](#income-management-feature) |
| **Turbopack warnings** | Added `turbopack: {}` to config | [Next.js Config](#performance-optimizations) |
| **Git push 403 error** | Created classic token with `repo` scope | [Git & GitHub Setup](#git--github-setup) |
| **Large file push failure** | Implemented Git LFS for 130 MB binary | [Git LFS Configuration](#git--github-setup) |
| **Slow WSL performance** | Moved project to Linux filesystem | [WSL2 Configuration](#development-environment-setup) |

### **Commands That Saved the Day**

```bash
# Nuclear reset when stuck
rm -rf .next node_modules/.cache
npm install
npm run dev -- --turbo

# PostgreSQL fix
sudo -u postgres pg_ctl -D /var/lib/pgsql/data start

# Redis fix
redis-server --dir /home/developer/redis-data --daemonize yes

# Git LFS migration
git lfs migrate import --include="*.node" --everything
git push --force
```

